  m_text: "<color=#9FD0FF>IEnumerator Crossfade(AudioSource a, AudioSource b, float time) {\n  b.volume = 0; b.Play();\n  for (float t = 0; t < time; t += Time.deltaTime) {\n    a.volume = 1 - t / time;\n    b.volume = t / time;\n    yield return null;\n  }\n  a.Stop();\n}</color>\n\n\u2022 AudioSource 2\uAC1C\uB97C \uBC88\uAC08\uC544 \uC0AC\uC6A9 (A\u2194B)\n\u2022 \uC77C\uC2DC\uC815\uC9C0 \uC911\uC5D0\uB3C4 \uBC14\uAFB8\uB824\uBA74 unscaledDeltaTime\n\u2022 Audio Mixer \uB97C \uC4F0\uBA74 Snapshot.TransitionTo(2f) \uB85C\uB3C4 \uAC00\uB2A5"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
